            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "spike-stitch"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "spike stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " over the back half of the body to mimic spines. No needle felting, no separate spine pieces. A smaller sphere forms the smooth face. Start both pieces with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The hedgehog sits about 10 cm tall and 12 cm long."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Materials"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "DK yarn: 50 g dark brown, 20 g cream. 3.5 mm crochet hook. Pair of 9 mm "
